[
    {
        "text": "\u7b2c\u4e8c\u5173\uff08\u524d\uff09",
        "tag": "header",
        "key": "title_test",
        "is_skippable": true,
        "fit_mode": "BLACK_MASK"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_lungmen_n",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "7:59 P.M. \\ Cloudy"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lungmen Aqueduct, Pier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Now don't go jumping onto any more boats! It's dangerous!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stranger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sorry, it's just, we were...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "text": "By the way, you didn't happen to see a Sankta lady around here, did you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "I didn't see anything. And I don't have time for this. These sweets are for the after party and are you gonna pay me if they turn up late... Oh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stranger"
    },
    {
        "text": "A S- Sankta...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stranger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_213_mostma_1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah! Mostim\u2014\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_101_sora_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mostima? You know Mostima?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_101_sora_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Sorry. I mistook you for someone else.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$marketplace_intro",
        "key": "$marketplace_loop",
        "volume": 0.8,
        "crossfade": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "(This lady sure looks familiar.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ahem. Anyway, I'll let you off this time. But don't go doing anything that dangerous ever again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stranger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "S- sorry. I didn't mean to trouble you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_101_sora_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm... Forte kid... there was something about a Forte kid... what was it...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_101_sora_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#2",
        "name2": "char_101_sora_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Aaah! What are you doing?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_101_sora_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You had some candy on your horn.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_101_sora_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, really? I should probably give it back to...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_101_sora_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "And looking at your horns reminded me of something! They're just like the Mountain Dash Logistics logo!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're the little prince of MDL, aren't you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#2",
        "name2": "char_101_sora_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Little... prince...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_lmstreet_2",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_101_sora_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Sora, ma'am, is this really the way back to Texas and the others?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_101_sora_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Relax, I know what Texas is thinking at all times. I can see right into her head.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_101_sora_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "text": "...her voice has such a familiar quality to it, but I can't put my finger on it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_101_sora_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "'Ma'am,' huh? Hehe, I never thought the day would come when young Messengers would be calling me that~ So what's your impression of everybody?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_101_sora_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Impression?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "initr": 2,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
