    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "initr": 2,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_lmstreet_2",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "cameraeffect",
        "effect": "Grayscale",
        "keep": true,
        "amount": 0,
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#2",
        "name2": "char_101_sora_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "They're very... um... spirited people.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_101_sora_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Ahahaha... I can guess what they must've put you through...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_101_sora_1#3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, sorry!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Watch where you're going! Ptoo!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "That was clearly your fault\u2014\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who asked you? Mind your own business!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "You little brat!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#4",
        "name2": "char_101_sora_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't worry about it. Let him go.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#4",
        "name2": "char_101_sora_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But he just swiped your wallet\u2014\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#4",
        "name2": "char_101_sora_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hehe, he sure did. But that wallet just had some pumpkin candies inside. See? This is the real one~",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "text": "You familiar with the old expression 'trick or treat'?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_101_sora_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "He was here just to make trouble, and today's not even... why would you have something like that?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_101_sora_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You may not be able to tell at first glance, but Lungmen's been through a lot lately.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sauin candles aren't bright enough to light up all the dark corners of this city, and those kids don't exactly have it easy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_101_sora_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "But hey, it's just something I came up with. Not bad, huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_101_sora_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What if he grabbed my wallet instead...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_101_sora_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Should be right up ahead.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$penguinlogistics_intro",
        "key": "$penguinlogistics_loop",
        "volume": 1,
        "crossfade": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_park",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_101_sora_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Isn't this... the park from before? Did we just make a big circle?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_101_sora_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "See? Here they are.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_031"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mmmh! Mmff mff!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1#7",
        "name2": "avg_npc_031",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Listen, if you don't talk, I'm gonna have to light this fuse.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_031",
        "name2": "char_201_moeshd",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Yer lips better start flappin', kiddo. These fireworks'll blow ya sky high.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croissant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "...You forgot to take the tape off his mouth.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_031",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, right. Haha.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_031"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014!!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso"
    },
    {
        "text": "You crazy broads! Do you have any idea who we are?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_031",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...the Siracusan Mafia.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_031",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Urk, T- Texas...? Don't think we're scared of you!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1#8",
        "name2": "avg_npc_031",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh we know you're not scared. Why else would you blow up all the boss's collectibles. A bomb in a candy box, though? That's kids' stuff.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1#8",
        "name2": "avg_npc_031",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...what are you talking about?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1#6",
        "name2": "avg_npc_031",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1#6",
        "name2": "avg_npc_031",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't know nothin' about no candy box. But if our capo did up a bomb, you'd all be in pieces\u2014\u2014 Mmmf! Mmmh!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1",
        "name2": "char_103_angel_1#7",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "This guy sure is full of himself. Let's blast him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1",
        "name2": "char_103_angel_1#6",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Patience, Exusiai. Let him talk.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1#6",
        "name2": "avg_npc_031",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "*Gasp*\u2014\u2014Hah. Ain't you the least bit curious why Lungmen's lettin' us get away with all this?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1#7",
        "name2": "avg_npc_031",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Not really. As long as we go down to the station once a month to pay our property damage fines, they pretty much let us do whatever too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1#7",
        "name2": "avg_npc_031",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Gah...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_031",
        "name2": "char_201_moeshd#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "C'mon, Exu, let the feller say his piece.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croissant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_031"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just look at you broads...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso"
    },
    {
        "text": "We got the big man's OK to do whatever we want to Penguin Logistics, right from the real power in Lungmen. You know what that means, don't you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1#8",
        "name2": "avg_npc_031",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "We're a legitimate logistics business? And a pretty good one at that?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_031",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Then why do we always end up... You know what? Forget it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_031",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Who's 'the big man' you're talking about?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1#7",
        "name2": "avg_npc_031",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It sounds really pretentious. Super gross.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_031"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't play dumb! The Rat King's\u2014\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_101_sora_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey! Texas! And the rest!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1#8"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, Sora! What's up~",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_201_moeshd#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "How about that. She wrangled Bison too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croissant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_101_sora_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hehe, I ran into this lost little calf on my way over, I thought I'd bring him along.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#4",
        "name2": "char_103_angel_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Um... what are you doing? And where's Mr. Emperor?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#4",
        "name2": "char_103_angel_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The boss went somewhere to do something.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_101_sora_1",
        "name2": "char_102_texas_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You didn't run into anyone else, Sora?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1#3",
        "name2": "char_101_sora_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm? I don't... think... so.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1#7",
        "name2": "char_101_sora_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? Do I have something on my face?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_101_sora_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "N- no. Anyway, Bison filled me in on the whole story. Where do we go from here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1#8",
        "name2": "avg_npc_031",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "First we get some more answers from our little buddy, then we formulate an appropriate... response.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#2",
        "name2": "char_103_angel_1#8",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait, Exusiai, do you mean...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "text": "I actually ran into Mostima back there. But then I lost her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "text": "Erm, I mean, after we shook the mobsters, she\u2014\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#2",
        "name2": "char_103_angel_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...don't worry about her. That's just how she is. Vanishing years at a time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#2",
        "name2": "char_103_angel_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...years?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_201_moeshd#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tell ya the truth, I barely seen heads or tails of her since they hired me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croissant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_101_sora_1#5",
        "name2": "char_201_moeshd#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Ahaha, let's not get Exusiai too riled up...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#2",
        "name2": "char_103_angel_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "This is all very... unorthodox.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "She's a special kind of Messenger.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "text": "Contractually, she works for the boss, but more often Laterano has her\u2014\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014\u2014Exusiai, watch your match.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? Oops.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_031"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true
    },
    {
        "text": "MMMMH! MMF\u2014\u2014!!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_201_moeshd"
    },
    {
        "text": "Darn it, looks like we're outta time. But that's the way the cookie crumbles.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croissant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_031"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true
    },
    {
        "text": "MMMMMNG!!!!!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso"
    },
