        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Heyo, that sounded like Fronzo! And it didn't sound good!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's get over there!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "So they really can send a person flying. These fireworks are something else.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We've got company. Six and three o'clock.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
